      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POCKET POINT (1) jumped cleanly last start and led all the way (23.00) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 400m. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Looks the testing material. QUICK THINKIN' (3) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and two minors from nine tries. Was out of placings last time (30.05) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. MISS ARIZONA (6) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 515m at this track in a useful 29.60 on October 2. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. ZIPPING HAGEN (2) looks an each-way chance.",
